{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "version": "1.0",
  "strings": {
    "Glide on these devices": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "慣性を使うデバイス"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move the cursor to detect devices…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "カーソルを動かすと、デバイスが表示されます…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn GlideCursor on to detect devices.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GlideCursor をオンにすると、デバイスが表示されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not connected": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未接続"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility permission is needed. GlideCursor can't see or move the cursor until it is allowed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アクセシビリティの許可が必要です。許可されるまで、GlideCursor はカーソルの動きを受け取れず、動かすこともできません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open Accessibility Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アクセシビリティ設定を開く"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If GlideCursor is already listed and on, remove it with − and add it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一覧に GlideCursor がオンで載っている場合は、「−」で一覧から消してから追加し直してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch detection is unavailable on this macOS version. Gliding is disabled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この macOS ではタッチを検出できないため、慣性は使えません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glide length": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "滑る長さ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long the cursor keeps gliding after you lift your finger.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指を離したあと、カーソルが滑り続ける長さです。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Speed": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "速さ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Multiplies the speed at the moment you lift your finger.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "指を離した瞬間の速さに掛ける倍率です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Flick threshold": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "弾きのしきい値"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lifting slower than this does not glide. Lower = easier to trigger.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これより遅く離したときは滑りません。小さいほど滑り出しやすくなります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Max speed": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最高速度"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Caps the starting speed of a glide.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "滑り始めの速さの上限です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ignore the tap that stops a glide": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "止めるためのタップをクリックにしない"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With tap to click, touching the trackpad to stop a glide won't also click.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「タップでクリック」を使っているとき、滑っているカーソルを止めるために触れても、クリックになりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press Key…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "キーを押してください…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "変更"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reset to Defaults": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "初期値に戻す"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Website": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Web サイト"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to GlideCursor": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GlideCursor へようこそ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Accessibility permissions are required to control the cursor.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "カーソルを動かすには、アクセシビリティの許可が必要です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Flick and lift to glide. Touch the trackpad to stop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "弾いて指を離すと滑ります。トラックパッドに触れると止まります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open System Settings": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "システム設定を開く"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Get Started": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "始める"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Language": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "言語"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System Default": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "システムの設定に従う"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open at Login": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ログイン時に開く"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit GlideCursor": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GlideCursor を終了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thank you!": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ありがとうございます!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can donate any time from the gear menu in the settings. If you like GlideCursor, we'd be glad of your support!": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "設定の歯車のメニューから、いつでも寄付できます。気に入ったら、応援よろしくお願いします!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GlideCursor is free": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GlideCursor は無料です"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If GlideCursor fits the way you work, a donation would help keep it going and working with future versions of macOS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手になじんだら、寄付で応援していただけるとうれしいです。いただいた寄付は、開発を続け、新しい macOS に対応するために使います。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Close": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "閉じる"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Donate": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "寄付する"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Donate…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "寄付する…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Don't show this again": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今後は表示しない"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Precision mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "精密モード"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Precision speed": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "精密モードの速さ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold for": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "待つ時間"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glide": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "慣性"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resets the sliders. Devices and shortcuts are kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "スライダーを初期値に戻します。デバイスとショートカットの設定は残ります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use precision mode": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "精密モードを使う"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Slows the cursor down for fine positioning, for example in a drawing app. No glide while it is on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "描画アプリなどで細かく位置を合わせるために、カーソルを遅くします。精密モードのあいだは滑りません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cursor moves this much slower in precision mode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "精密モードのあいだ、カーソルがこの倍率で遅くなります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to start": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "入り方"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keyboard shortcut": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "キーボードショートカット"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Double-tap and hold": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ダブルタップホールド"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shortcut": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ショートカット"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press it once to start, and again to leave.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1回押すと入り、もう1回押すと出ます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Double-tap, keep your finger down for this long, and precision mode starts. Lift to leave.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ダブルタップして、この時間だけ指を置いたままにすると、精密モードに入ります。指を離すと出ます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you use double-tap to drag (Dragging or Drag Lock in the trackpad settings), the two clash. Use the keyboard shortcut instead. With tap to click, the first tap also clicks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ダブルタップでドラッグする設定(トラックパッドの「ドラッグ」や「ドラッグロック」)を使っている場合は、操作がぶつかります。キーボードショートカットを使ってください。また「タップでクリック」を使っていると、1回目のタップはクリックになります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GlideCursor is on. You can turn it off from the menu bar icon.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GlideCursor はオンになっています。メニューバーのアイコンからオフにできます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On/off shortcut": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "オン・オフのショートカット"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}